# This repo is built and tested on Linux (and in GitHub Actions on ubuntu
# runners). Shell scripts under openwrt/ are installed verbatim onto the router
# and executed by BusyBox sh, so a stray CR would break `#!/bin/sh` and string
# comparisons. Force LF for all text files, keep the committed runtime tarball
# (and any other binary) out of the CRLF conversion entirely.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.tar.gz binary
*.apk binary
*.so binary
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
